 * Varactor-tuned Colpitts FM modulator - fixed version


 ****     CIRCUIT DESCRIPTION


******************************************************************************



* Nodes: 1=Vcc, 2=base, 3/9=tank ends, 4=emitter, 5=collector, 8=varactor bias
*
* --- Supplies & message ---
V2  1 0 DC 12
V3  6 0 SIN(0 4 1k)            ; message: 4 V PEAK (2.83 V rms); use 10k for scope viewing
V1  7 6 DC 6                   ; varactor bias, stacked on the message
*
* --- Transistor & bias ---
Q1  5 2 4 2N3394               ; 2N3904 also works
-------------------------------$
ERROR -- Missing model
R1  1 2 28k
R2  2 0 10k
R3  1 5 2.2k                   ; was 1k  -> Ic ~1 mA, less overdrive
R4  4 10 100                   ; unbypassed part of emitter resistor
R7  10 0 2.2k                  ; NEW: bypassed part
C1  10 0 10u                   ; bypass across R7 only
*
* --- Tank ---
C2  5 3 100n
C3  2 9 2.2n                   ; was 100n -> keeps audio out of the base
L1  3 9 1m
C4  3 0 330p                   ; was 1n
C5  9 0 330p                   ; was 3.3n  (C4 = C5 is important)
R6  3 0 1meg
*
* --- Back-to-back varactors (C6 removed) ---
D1  3 8 BB112                  ; anode node 3, cathode node 8
D2  9 8 BB112                  ; NEW: anode node 9, cathode node 8
R5  7 8 10k
*
.tran 20n 3m 0 20n
.end
